@startuml
title RF46 — Configurações com padrão LGPD e tradução completa · Máquina de estados: UserAccount.status
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FFF7EE
skinparam StateBorderColor #DC5B26
state "ACTIVE" as ACTIVE
state "BLOCKED" as BLOCKED
state "PENDING_DELETION" as PENDING_DELETION
PENDING_DELETION : 7 dias de arrependimento
state "DELETED" as DELETED
[*] --> ACTIVE
ACTIVE --> BLOCKED : tentativas de login
BLOCKED --> ACTIVE : bloqueio expira
ACTIVE --> PENDING_DELETION : senha + palavra
PENDING_DELETION --> ACTIVE : cancelar no prazo
PENDING_DELETION --> DELETED : prazo vencido · anonimização
DELETED --> [*]
@enduml
